1.4.21  2026-06-17
  - Solo GBT: append empty Verium vchBlockSig to submitblock payload (fixes
    "Block decode failed" after nTime coinbase fix).
  - Build: run Prettier --write on build instead of failing format-check.

1.4.20  2026-06-17
  - Solo GBT: include Verium nTime in coinbase so submitblock is accepted by veriumd.
  - Solo GBT: encode submitblock header without mutating work->data (safe retries).
1.4.19  2026-06-16
  - Solo / veriumd: fix CLI -O RPC credentials and --coinbase-addr being wiped on
    second parse (macOS optreset); accept GBT block version 7 from veriumd.
  - Solo / veriumd: ignore empty url/user/pass in JSON config; fix setup wizard
    Enter-on-default wiping pool URL and threads.
  - Solo logging: status panel (Solo connected, payout, height, blocks found),
    decimal network difficulty, block candidate/found on network-target hits.
  - UX: --log-frequency (ultra/fast/medium/slow) for status panel cadence;
    --color-theme (dark/light/auto/off) for light vs dark terminals; NO_COLOR
    honored when theme is auto.
  - UX: logfmt_diff_decimal — network/pool/share difficulty always shown as
    0.0xxxx (never scientific notation) in logs.

1.4.18  2026-06-13
  - Windows: disable console Quick Edit on startup (click-to-select paused the whole
    miner, not just log output).
  - applog: release lock before writing to stdout so a blocked console cannot wedge
    stratum job processing behind applog_lock.

1.4.17  2026-06-13
  - Setup wizard: fix Enter-on-default for pool URL, password, and threads (prompt
    no longer uses the same buffer for default and input).
  - Setup wizard: choose Pool vs Solo first; validate URLs and strip stray trailing
    characters (e.g. "]" from bracketed defaults).
  - Sanitize saved pool URLs at startup; setup abort exits cleanly instead of dumping usage.

1.4.16  2026-06-13
  - Fix pool/stratum connection when config has empty "url" (ignore blank url/user/pass
    in JSON; fall back to default Vericonomy pool; always enable stratum for stratum+tcp URLs).
  - Setup wizard: reject/sanitize empty pool URL and default empty password to "x".

1.4.15  2026-06-13
  - Windows: embed Vericonomy logo in cpuminer.exe and veriumminer-setup.exe
    (res/cpuminer.ico; NSIS MUI_ICON / MUI_UNICON).

1.4.14  2026-06-13
  - Fix cppcheck uninitvar warning for vm_statistics64_data_t on macOS probe.
  - Includes all 1.4.13 Windows first-run / setup crash fixes (use this release).

1.4.13  2026-06-13
  - Windows: fix scrypt scratchpad free when VirtualAlloc fails and malloc fallback
    was used (VirtualFree on heap memory crashed after setup / on worker exit).
  - Windows: fix SYSTEM_CPU_SET_INFORMATION layout (ULONG Id) for hybrid CPU detection.
  - Windows: conservative auto-thread RAM budget and stagger scratchpad allocation
    so first-run mining after --setup is less likely to OOM or hard-exit.
  - Guard restart_threads() when work_restart is not yet allocated.

1.4.12  2026-06-13
  - Fix cppcheck uninitvar warning in topo_build_worker_schedule (guard qsort when n==0).
  - CI: run Prettier via node (vendored node_modules/.bin lacks +x on Linux).
  - Prettier-format api/websocket.htm and solo mining docs.

1.4.11  2026-06-12
  - Topology: OS-driven worker schedule (Linux core_type, Windows CpuSet efficiency)
    instead of hardcoded 24/16 hybrid tables; auto threads = min(logical CPUs, RAM).
  - Solo/baremetal fleet target: includes 1.4.9–1.4.10 fixes (FireWorm flags,
    --ryzen, L3 recommended<=1 bug, opt_ryzen link fix). See docs/BAREMETAL_SOLO.md.

1.4.10  2026-06-12
  - Fix CI/test link: define opt_ryzen in libvrm_scrypt_core (scrypt.c) so test
    binaries that link the static scrypt library resolve the symbol.

1.4.9  2026-06-12
  - Solo / baremetal: restore FireWorm CLI flags (--no-getwork, --no-gbt,
    --no-longpoll, --ryzen) in getopt and --help (handlers existed but were
    omitted from the options table in 1.4.x).
  - Fix auto-thread recommendation on desktop Ryzen/Xeon: L3 heuristic no longer
    caps every scrypt^2 worker to 1 thread (~768 MB ROM vs ~32 MB L3).
  - Solo http:// URLs auto-disable Stratum; warn when --coinbase-addr is missing.
  - docs/SOLO_MINING.md and docs/BAREMETAL_SOLO.md: remote RPC and migration notes.

1.4.8  2026-06-10
  - ARM64: restore 3-way NEON scrypt core (~1.8× hashrate on Apple Silicon / Linux
    arm64; ~384 MB/thread scratchpad). Banner shows "ARMV8 NEON".
  - macOS Intel: re-enable x86_64 AVX2 assembly (was blocked by blanket Apple gate).
  - Restore fireworm --oneways / -1 N mixed 1-way + 3-way thread tuning.
  - Add scrypt 3-way lane equivalence test (ctest scrypt_3way_equiv).
  - SBC heuristic: cap threads when NEON scratchpad exceeds 200 MB on low-core boards.
  - ENABLE_ARM_CRYPTO CMake option (SHA2 extension hook; acceleration deferred).

